+// SoloWoW: real kits for the sim's people (Nov 17 night) - "full gear generation".
+//
+// Every adventurer owns a kit of the game's real items, kept in sim_agent.kit ("slot:entry:suffix:enchant,...") whether
+// or not they have ever had a body near the player. It is built and changed with the same rules their body uses
+// (bot_ai::CanEquipFor - class, level, slot, weapon skills, armour types - and NPCBots' sorted gear lists), and shaped
+// for the look of progression: quality by level band (greens early, blues from the 20s, epics near 60 and rare),
+// armour that hangs together from 30 (one name family), level-gated slots (rings/neck/shoulders from 20, head and
+// trinkets from 30). What happens to them changes it: each level, a rare find, savings spent, a smith's work mark pieces
+// due, and the sim replaces the weakest due pieces with something better (World::RefreshKits). The kit sets their gear
+// tier, which the sim's fights use.
+#include "solosim_gear.h"
+#include "bot_ai.h"
